          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Chinese Blackjack is an East and Southeast Asian twenty-one banking game also known as ban-luck, ban-nag, or xi dach."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Chinese Blackjack is a regional twenty-one family game played in South East Asian communities, with local names in Hokkien, Cantonese, and Vietnamese."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
