              "text": "52-card standard pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A banker deals cards to players, who compare totals against the banker under local twenty-one rules."
